-- เก็บท้องฟ้า/Atmosphere เดิมไว้ เพื่อให้เลือก "แบบเดิม" แล้วคืนค่าได้
pcall(function()
    for _, obj in ipairs(Lighting:GetChildren()) do
        if obj:IsA("Sky") then
            local clone = obj:Clone()
            clone.Parent = nil
            table.insert(originalSkyClones, clone)
        elseif obj:IsA("Atmosphere") then
            local clone = obj:Clone()
            clone.Parent = nil
            table.insert(originalAtmosphereClones, clone)
        end
    end
end)

local function removeCurrentSkyAndAtmosphere()
    for _, obj in ipairs(Lighting:GetChildren()) do
        if obj:IsA("Sky") or obj:IsA("Atmosphere") then
            obj:Destroy()
        end
    end
end

local function restoreOriginalSky()
    removeCurrentSkyAndAtmosphere()

    for _, clone in ipairs(originalSkyClones) do
        pcall(function() clone:Clone().Parent = Lighting end)
    end
    for _, clone in ipairs(originalAtmosphereClones) do
        pcall(function() clone:Clone().Parent = Lighting end)
    end

    for property, value in pairs(originalLightingSettings) do
        pcall(function() Lighting[property] = value end)
    end
end

